      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-122559\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">1.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/3344#9473\">Identifying a Three-Dimensional Vector Field</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"122559\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionGraphicFrame\"><img class=\"questionGraphic\" src=\"/graphics/q-122559\"/></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Which of the following could be the function that generates the vector field above?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Sun, Oct 11th @ 10:27 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:32</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
